{
  "_comment": "User-filled values for modules whose content carries __TOKEN__ placeholders. Key = module name; each field has {key,label,kind,default}. kind: text | password | choice | number | file (choice adds an 'options' list of {label,value}; number = digits-only; file = path with a Browse button). At generation, __KEY__ in the module content is replaced by the entered/chosen value.",

